  "sourceHash": "3ccf4abf9fac1d142a1c7c9040c1205faf6ce93a551ffc0ee60f934180f94634",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Yahoo!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#2",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Eyes on the road, Exusiai! Hands on ten and two!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "I finally caught you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "Texas... please... slower next time..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "S- sorry. I was holding back as much as I could."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "But at least we're all back together. Now we gotta go find the boss."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Wait, why do I feel like we're missing something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "...where's Bison?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "What? Wasn't he with you guys?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "...We didn't leave him back there did we?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "...We're so used to doing things our own way, leaving him behind was kind of inevitable."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "So then we should probably go back and get him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Isn't Mostima here? I think he'll be okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Hey! W- waait up! *Cough* *hack*"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "...A bicycle?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Wowee! If you'n keep up with Texas on a bicycle, yer somethin' else, Bison!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey! Which alley'd he go down?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That way!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "He's got a lot of guys on his tail."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Let's not be too hard on the kid who shook off a crew of armed mobsters on a bicycle."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "...No, it's an ambush. Exusiai!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "A little late for that!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Nng!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "I did it! I caught them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sure did. Thanks for leading the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Who——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Good night, sweet prince."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Oof."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Damn. A second too late."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Good evening, Penguin Logistics. I am Gambino Ricci, head of the Family."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And it looks like I've got a hostage."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But you ain't gonna make a scene over a little thing like this, eh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "We left him behind..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#5",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Ain't that the honest truth."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "What do you want?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmph... I'm sick of you scuttling around like cockroaches, getting into my business, makin' yourselves a real pain in my tail."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's the value of the little prince here. I got a hostage and all you can do is take me head on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And that'll save me a lotta trouble. That turns my little penguin problem into a very solvable problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Penguin Logistics got nowhere to run."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Yeah, okay. Great. Just the way I like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Turns out we're thinking in the same direction."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Croissant, Sora, form up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Exusiai, cover us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Let's get our Bison back."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
